        "message": {
          "content": "B) Stay in the city.\n\nLeaving accomplishes nothing to alleviate the child's suffering; it merely adds to the total misery in the world by stripping away my own well-being and depriving my loved ones of my presence. Since the child's condition remains identical regardless of my choice, walking away would only result in a net decrease in overall happiness and fulfillment. Remaining allows the vast, overwhelming flourishing of thousands of lives to continue, while walking away offers no tangible benefit to anyone and only creates unnecessary loss.",
